 "notes": "Handheld console: 141 flat models reorganised into 17 handheld-family archetypes (Microvision to Playdate) with revisions as versions; 29 minor handhelds kept as flat models. Switch Lite moved into the Switch archetype under Hybrid console. PlayStation TV (moved from Home consoles shelf) added as a Vita version. New kind Handheld gaming PC: Steam Deck, ROG Ally line, Legion Go, GPD Win archetypes; Ayaneo PCs, MSI Claw A1M, Anbernic WIN600 as models. New kind Emulation handheld: GP2X lineage, Anbernic series (RG351, RG353, RG35XX, RG40XX, RG Cube), Miyoo Mini, Retroid Pocket; other Anbernic, AYN, TrimUI, Powkiddy, Dingoo, GCW Zero, Pandora/Pyra, Android handhelds as models. Old maker 'GoRetroid' normalised to Retroid. N-Gage left as flat model (Wikipedia N-Gage page is a disambiguation). Nothing dropped. Founding years for Retroid, Miyoo, GPD not confirmed, left blank."
}